  "author": "Lakonik (pi-H3 adapters and ComfyUI-piFlow)",
  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "Model format: int8 ConvRot. Steps: 2 by default.\n\nLakonik's pi-H3, a two-step pi-Flow distillation of MiniMax H3 on the standard FL2VA weights. The last step produces the picture directly, so there is no video VAE decode. Text to video and image to video (first frame, optional last frame); no reference-to-video. In the app on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti a five-second 480p shot took 31-33 s, against 36.5 s for TaoMate 3-Step. With the same base files installed, only the 2.2 GB adapter downloads.",
  "tags": [
    "2-Step",
    "Distill",
    "I2V",
    "Local",
    "MiniMax H3",
    "T2V",
    "Video"
  ],
