      "previewImage": "previews/minimax-h3-pi-t2v.jpg",
      "description": "Describe a scene and get video with matching stereo sound in two sampling steps. A five-second 480p shot took 31-33 s on a 12 GB card in the app, against 36.5 s for TaoMate 3-Step.\n\nGood for drafts and for checking a prompt before a slower, higher-quality preset. In tests the camera moved more freely than on TaoMate, and small faces in a crowd held up. An occasional small face still comes out smeared; re-roll the seed.\n\nSteps are fixed at two. Sol-Attn stays off because it smears small faces with this model.\n\nA 15-second shot at the 768p tier does not fit in 12 GB.\n\nModel format: int8 ConvRot.",
